## Case: read-moved-dependency-global
id: "av.parity.1085.read-moved-dependency-global"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1085"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
use lib.run
fn main() int { return run() }
```

#### lib.at

```auto
type Packet { text Str }
var packet = Packet("answer".clone())
fn consume(move p Packet) int { return p.text.len() }
pub fn run() int { let used = consume(packet.move); return used + packet.text.len() }
```

