## Case: reassign-moved-global
id: "av.parity.1085.reassign-moved-global"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1085"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
type Packet { text Str }
var packet = Packet("answer".clone())
fn take(move p Packet) int { if p.text == "answer" { return 42 }; return 0 }
fn main() int { let value = take(packet.move); packet = Packet("again".clone()); return packet.text.len() + value }
```

