entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
fn make() fn(int) -> int {
    let owned = "ok".clone()
    return move (x int) => x + owned.len()
}
var f fn(int) -> int = make()
var hit = 0
fn main() int { hit = hit + 1; return f(39) + hit }
```

