## Case: object-global
id: "av.parity.1085.object-global"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1085"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
var obj = { n: 40, title: "ok", enabled: true }
fn main() int {
    let first int = obj["n"]
    obj = { n: first + 2, title: "new", enabled: true }
    if obj["title"] == "new" && obj["enabled"] { return obj["n"] }
    return 0
}
```

